# astrion-skill v1
goal: Prepare for a video meeting — mute notifications, mute mic check
trigger:
  - phrase: "start meeting"
  - phrase: "meeting mode"
  - phrase: "going on a call"
do: |
  Enable Do Not Disturb. Set system volume to 60% (audible but not
  loud). Toggle the camera/mic check app open if installed. Record
  a 'meeting' graph node with start timestamp so the meeting shows
  up in today-agenda + weekly digest. Show notification: "Meeting
  mode on. Say 'end meeting' when done."
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 250
  reversibility: BOUNDED
